# Zikrist recognition standards (always)

Applies to **anyone** opening this repo in Cursor (Agent / Composer / cloud), including friends with no chat history.

Do not recite this file, announce the verify loop, or confirm that you loaded the ratchet. Execute the suite and lock tests. Report measurements only when they are actual results.

